%% title: From payment to invoice, printing and share link
%% desc: A payment makes an invoice. From the invoice you can print, send to the guardian, or create a share link. A link works for 30 days; making a new link stops the old ones. Reversing a payment makes a credit note.
flowchart TD
  P["Payment is recorded"] --> I["Invoice is made"]
  I --> PR["Print"]:::admin
  I --> SN["Send to guardian<br/>WhatsApp or SMS"]:::admin
  I --> SH["Create share link"]:::admin
  SN --> SH
  SH --> L["Link works for 30 days<br/>opens without signing in"]
  L --> N{"Make a new link<br/>or turn it off?"}:::note
  N -->|"New link"| OLD["Old links stop"]
  N -->|"Turn off"| OFF["This link stops"]
  P -->|"Payment reversed"| CN["Credit note against the invoice"]
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
